1
00:00:05,000 --> 00:00:08,000
[narrator] In the forest of the Dentora
region of the Republic of Padokea

2
00:00:09,000 --> 00:00:14,000
lies a dormant volcano,
measuring 3,722 meters high.

3
00:00:14,000 --> 00:00:16,000
It is known as Kukuroo Mountain.

4
00:00:17,000 --> 00:00:21,000
It is home to a family
of famous assassins, The Zoldyck family.

5
00:00:23,000 --> 00:00:27,000
Visitors arrive every day in hopes
of catching a glimpse of the mansion,

6
00:00:27,000 --> 00:00:29,000
which has never been seen.

7
00:00:29,000 --> 00:00:33,000
It's one of this nation's
most popular tourist attractions.

8
00:00:33,000 --> 00:00:35,000
LAMENTATION TOURS

9
00:00:36,000 --> 00:00:39,000
[theme song plays]

10
00:01:56,000 --> 00:02:00,000
I have a message from Killua
that he asked me to relay to you.

11
00:02:00,000 --> 00:02:04,000
"Thank you for coming.
I'm happy that you did.

12
00:02:05,000 --> 00:02:07,000
But I can't see you right now.

13
00:02:09,000 --> 00:02:10,000
I'm sorry."

14
00:02:11,000 --> 00:02:16,000
THE X ZOLDYCK X FAMILY

15
00:02:18,000 --> 00:02:23,000
[narrator] Gon, Kurapika and Leorio
have advanced a little closer

16
00:02:23,000 --> 00:02:26,000
to their destination, The Zoldyck Mansion.

17
00:02:27,000 --> 00:02:28,000
Meanwhile...

18
00:02:36,000 --> 00:02:37,000
[Killua] I'm home.

19
00:02:40,000 --> 00:02:42,000
[scoffs] Not like anyone's around.

20
00:02:45,000 --> 00:02:46,000
[Illumi] Welcome back.

21
00:02:47,000 --> 00:02:50,000
So, how did work go today?

22
00:02:51,000 --> 00:02:52,000
Just fine.

23
00:02:52,000 --> 00:02:55,000
Does that mean
you flawlessly dispatched your target?

24
00:02:56,000 --> 00:03:00,000
Why ask? I'm sure you already know.
You were spying, right?

25
00:03:00,000 --> 00:03:01,000
[Illumi chuckles]

26
00:03:01,000 --> 00:03:04,000
Mom is waiting to talk to you inside.

27
00:03:05,000 --> 00:03:07,000
-Don't wanna see her.
-I see.

28
00:03:14,000 --> 00:03:15,000
[chuckles]

29
00:03:20,000 --> 00:03:21,000
Huh?

30
00:03:43,000 --> 00:03:45,000
[inhales, gasps]

31
00:03:49,000 --> 00:03:51,000
Did you need something?

32
00:03:52,000 --> 00:03:54,000
Oh, I wanted to say hello.

33
00:03:55,000 --> 00:03:56,000
Are you new here?

34
00:03:57,000 --> 00:04:02,000
I am. While you were away, I was hired on
as an apprentice butler, Master Killua.

35
00:04:02,000 --> 00:04:03,000
My name is Canary.

36
00:04:04,000 --> 00:04:06,000
-Oh, hey. You can have this.
-No, thanks.

37
00:04:06,000 --> 00:04:09,000
But I do appreciate the gesture,
Master Killua.

38
00:04:09,000 --> 00:04:12,000
You don't have to be so formal.
Just call me Killua.

39
00:04:12,000 --> 00:04:15,000
I'm afraid I can't do that.
You are my employer,

40
00:04:16,000 --> 00:04:18,000
and I am just a humble employee.

41
00:04:19,000 --> 00:04:21,000
Wow. That's pretty stupid.

42
00:04:27,000 --> 00:04:28,000
[chuckles]

43
00:04:28,000 --> 00:04:30,000
[Killua] You were using the Silent Gait,
weren't you?

44
00:04:30,000 --> 00:04:31,000
The Silent Gait?

45
00:04:32,000 --> 00:04:36,000
The one where you move silently,
so you're completely undetectable.

46
00:04:37,000 --> 00:04:38,000
In the Zoldyck family,

47
00:04:39,000 --> 00:04:41,000
it's one of the first techniques
that we ever learn.

48
00:04:41,000 --> 00:04:45,000
-Perfect for assassination.
-I didn't realize.

49
00:04:45,000 --> 00:04:48,000
I suppose it's one of the many techniques
I learned

50
00:04:48,000 --> 00:04:50,000
while I was growing up in Meteor City.

51
00:04:51,000 --> 00:04:52,000
Meteor City?

52
00:04:53,000 --> 00:04:56,000
Yes. That's where I was born.

53
00:04:58,000 --> 00:05:00,000
A city that has been erased
from this world.

54
00:05:01,000 --> 00:05:03,000
Huh? Well, never heard of it.

55
00:05:04,000 --> 00:05:07,000
Where I come from,
you're allowed to dump anything there.

56
00:05:07,000 --> 00:05:11,000
Which sort of explains
why so many members of the Mafia

57
00:05:11,000 --> 00:05:13,000
and the Phantom Troupe come from there.

58
00:05:13,000 --> 00:05:15,000
I'd like to see it one of these days.

59
00:05:15,000 --> 00:05:19,000
When you do, I'd be happy to serve
as your guide. [chuckles]

60
00:05:21,000 --> 00:05:22,000
[chuckles]

61
00:05:27,000 --> 00:05:29,000
You know the Rhythm Echo?

62
00:05:30,000 --> 00:05:34,000
-The Rhythm Echo? What is that?
-A technique using the Silent Gait.

63
00:05:36,000 --> 00:05:38,000
[gasps]

64
00:05:44,000 --> 00:05:46,000
If you just keep moving
at a particular rhythm,

65
00:05:46,000 --> 00:05:48,000
it makes afterimages.

66
00:05:48,000 --> 00:05:50,000
I see what you mean. Hm?

67
00:05:52,000 --> 00:05:56,000
It seems we have intruders.
Quite a few of them, in fact.

68
00:05:56,000 --> 00:05:58,000
Don't worry. Mike can handle it.

69
00:05:58,000 --> 00:06:02,000
Mike is restrained today.
Those are the orders I was given.

70
00:06:03,000 --> 00:06:06,000
They wish to test my abilities,
so I must comply.

71
00:06:07,000 --> 00:06:08,000
Hmm...

72
00:06:13,000 --> 00:06:15,000
We'll split up here
and keep searching the mountain

73
00:06:15,000 --> 00:06:17,000
until we find their mansion. Huh?

74
00:06:22,000 --> 00:06:23,000
Please leave, right now.

75
00:06:24,000 --> 00:06:26,000
And just who the hell are you?

76
00:06:27,000 --> 00:06:31,000
[Canary] Who I am is none of your concern.
You're trespassing on private property.

77
00:06:32,000 --> 00:06:35,000
I can't allow you to pass
without permission.

78
00:06:36,000 --> 00:06:39,000
Do you really think
a brat like you can stop us?

79
00:06:40,000 --> 00:06:43,000
Look, you obviously don't stand a chance.

80
00:06:43,000 --> 00:06:47,000
Stand aside and we'll spare your life.
How's that for a deal?

81
00:06:48,000 --> 00:06:52,000
Take one step past this line,
and I'll remove you by force.

82
00:06:52,000 --> 00:06:53,000
What was that?

83
00:06:54,000 --> 00:06:58,000
Leave this one to us, boss.
No reason to get your hands dirty.

84
00:06:59,000 --> 00:07:00,000
-Let's go!
-Yeah!

85
00:07:01,000 --> 00:07:02,000
You messed with the wrong crew!

86
00:07:04,000 --> 00:07:05,000
Huh.

87
00:07:06,000 --> 00:07:08,000
[Seaquant yells]

88
00:07:08,000 --> 00:07:11,000
[men grunting]

89
00:07:14,000 --> 00:07:17,000
[groaning]

90
00:07:21,000 --> 00:07:23,000
-Damn it!
-Get her!

91
00:07:23,000 --> 00:07:25,000
[men yelling]

92
00:07:27,000 --> 00:07:29,000
[grunting]

93
00:07:30,000 --> 00:07:32,000
[men groaning]

94
00:07:34,000 --> 00:07:36,000
[groaning]

95
00:07:37,000 --> 00:07:38,000
-[boss grunts]
-[men groaning]

96
00:07:43,000 --> 00:07:45,000
[weak groaning]

97
00:07:45,000 --> 00:07:47,000
Do you wish to continue?

98
00:07:48,000 --> 00:07:51,000
[boss] She took down all these grown men
without even breaking a sweat.

99
00:07:53,000 --> 00:07:55,000
Are you a member of the Zoldyck family?

100
00:07:56,000 --> 00:08:00,000
Certainly not.
I am merely an apprentice butler.

101
00:08:00,000 --> 00:08:04,000
With your limited abilities,
you're not even a match for the butlers,

102
00:08:04,000 --> 00:08:07,000
not to mention the Zoldyck family.

103
00:08:07,000 --> 00:08:08,000
[boss] Grr!

104
00:08:11,000 --> 00:08:13,000
[roaring]

105
00:08:13,000 --> 00:08:14,000
How utterly meaningless.

106
00:08:15,000 --> 00:08:16,000
[boss roars]

107
00:08:17,000 --> 00:08:19,000
[boss grunts]

108
00:08:23,000 --> 00:08:25,000
As I said, this is meaningless!

109
00:08:25,000 --> 00:08:26,000
[grunts]

110
00:08:29,000 --> 00:08:31,000
[roars]

111
00:08:34,000 --> 00:08:36,000
[groans]

112
00:08:39,000 --> 00:08:41,000
[gasps]

113
00:08:42,000 --> 00:08:44,000
[Canary grunts]

114
00:08:46,000 --> 00:08:48,000
[sneers] I'm a Hunter, kid,

115
00:08:48,000 --> 00:08:52,000
and there's no way
I'm gonna lose to a little girl.

116
00:08:52,000 --> 00:08:53,000
Hm.

117
00:08:54,000 --> 00:08:55,000
[grunts]

118
00:08:56,000 --> 00:09:00,000
[boss cackles] Prepare yourself, kid!

119
00:09:03,000 --> 00:09:04,000
[gasps]

120
00:09:04,000 --> 00:09:05,000
What?

121
00:09:09,000 --> 00:09:10,000
[grumbles]

122
00:09:10,000 --> 00:09:16,000
It's time to die! [grunting]

123
00:09:18,000 --> 00:09:20,000
[boss screams]

124
00:09:27,000 --> 00:09:32,000
[whimpers, yelps] I'm sorry!
Please don't kill me! I'm begging you!

125
00:09:33,000 --> 00:09:34,000
Zebro.

126
00:09:34,000 --> 00:09:38,000
-So you knew I was here, did you?
-Would you mind taking care of the rest?

127
00:09:39,000 --> 00:09:42,000
Ah, of course.
Clean-up's my job, after all.

128
00:09:42,000 --> 00:09:45,000
Besides, Mike is starving.

129
00:09:47,000 --> 00:09:51,000
Huh? [screams]

130
00:09:52,000 --> 00:09:55,000
No! Somebody help me, please!
[whimpers]

131
00:09:59,000 --> 00:10:00,000
[chuckles]

132
00:10:06,000 --> 00:10:10,000
-So, you knew Rhythm Echo already?
-Yes, I did.

133
00:10:10,000 --> 00:10:12,000
I hope you'll forgive me.

134
00:10:12,000 --> 00:10:16,000
Hmm. You think you're stronger than I am.

135
00:10:17,000 --> 00:10:19,000
-Absolutely not.
-Oh, really?

136
00:10:20,000 --> 00:10:23,000
I don't have any friends.

137
00:10:26,000 --> 00:10:28,000
Will you be my friend, Canary?

138
00:10:32,000 --> 00:10:33,000
[gasps]

139
00:10:45,000 --> 00:10:48,000
I'm sorry, Master Killua. I honestly am.

140
00:10:48,000 --> 00:10:51,000
[scoffs] That's so stupid.

141
00:10:56,000 --> 00:10:57,000
[Gon] Let's be friends!

142
00:11:08,000 --> 00:11:09,000
Gon.

143
00:11:10,000 --> 00:11:13,000
HUNTER GLOSSARY

144
00:11:13,000 --> 00:11:14,000
Hmm?

145
00:11:16,000 --> 00:11:18,000
CANARY

146
00:11:19,000 --> 00:11:20,000
Humph.

147
00:11:28,000 --> 00:11:29,000
[Gon] Is she okay?

148
00:11:29,000 --> 00:11:32,000
She's fine. She's just lost consciousness.

149
00:11:39,000 --> 00:11:42,000
[growls] Wake up!

150
00:11:46,000 --> 00:11:50,000
Oh. Hey, good morning, big bro.
What time is it?

151
00:11:51,000 --> 00:11:54,000
[grunts] You arrogant little punk!

152
00:11:54,000 --> 00:11:59,000
Arrogant? C'mon, look, I feel really awful
about stabbing you, big bro.

153
00:11:59,000 --> 00:12:02,000
Sorry. I realize
I shouldn't have done that.

154
00:12:03,000 --> 00:12:06,000
You liar! [grunting]

155
00:12:10,000 --> 00:12:12,000
Can't fool you, huh?

156
00:12:13,000 --> 00:12:16,000
-[growls] Tsk!
-[phone ringing]

157
00:12:18,000 --> 00:12:22,000
[Milluki] Yes? Oh, hi, Mama! Uh-huh.

158
00:12:22,000 --> 00:12:26,000
[gasps] Yep, I understand.

159
00:12:26,000 --> 00:12:30,000
-[phone beeps]
-Well, Kil, you might wanna know,

160
00:12:30,000 --> 00:12:33,000
those friends of yours are over
at the butlers' quarters.

161
00:12:34,000 --> 00:12:36,000
[cackles] How about it, Kil?

162
00:12:37,000 --> 00:12:40,000
Should I ask Mama
to have the three of them--

163
00:12:40,000 --> 00:12:41,000
[crashing]

164
00:12:43,000 --> 00:12:44,000
[Killua] Milluki...

165
00:12:45,000 --> 00:12:48,000
[echoes] If you so much as touch them,
I'll kill you.

166
00:12:55,000 --> 00:12:57,000
I'm sorry. How rude of me.

167
00:12:57,000 --> 00:13:01,000
I am Killua's mother, you see,
and this is Kalluto.

168
00:13:05,000 --> 00:13:08,000
Why can't Killua come to see us?
Where is he?

169
00:13:09,000 --> 00:13:10,000
In solitary confinement.

170
00:13:11,000 --> 00:13:12,000
Wait, what?

171
00:13:12,000 --> 00:13:17,000
Before he ran away from home,
Killua stabbed his brother, and me.

172
00:13:18,000 --> 00:13:19,000
Yes, that's what he told us.

173
00:13:20,000 --> 00:13:24,000
And then, because he regretted
what he had done,

174
00:13:24,000 --> 00:13:25,000
our Killua returned to us,

175
00:13:26,000 --> 00:13:29,000
and entered solitary confinement,
voluntarily.

176
00:13:30,000 --> 00:13:33,000
In any case, we don't know
when he will choose to leave.

177
00:13:34,000 --> 00:13:38,000
[gasps] What? What is happening?
What are you doing, Father?

178
00:13:38,000 --> 00:13:42,000
Please, don't do anything hasty!
He's only just returned!

179
00:13:45,000 --> 00:13:47,000
-[Milluki] Huh?
-[Zeno] I'm coming in.

180
00:13:51,000 --> 00:13:52,000
ONE KILL A DAY

181
00:13:53,000 --> 00:13:56,000
I believe that'll do for now. Thank you.

182
00:13:56,000 --> 00:14:00,000
But Grandpa Zeno,
he isn't even sorry, not one bit!

183
00:14:00,000 --> 00:14:02,000
[Zeno] Yes, I'm aware of that.

184
00:14:03,000 --> 00:14:06,000
You may go now, Kil.

185
00:14:06,000 --> 00:14:07,000
[Killua] Okay.

186
00:14:09,000 --> 00:14:10,000
[grunts]

187
00:14:11,000 --> 00:14:13,000
-[grunts]
-Huh?

188
00:14:16,000 --> 00:14:21,000
Man, that really hurt.
Hey, Milluki, you're right. I'm not sorry,

189
00:14:21,000 --> 00:14:23,000
but I do feel bad.

190
00:14:24,000 --> 00:14:26,000
That's why I let you slap me around
for a little while.

191
00:14:26,000 --> 00:14:28,000
[Milluki] What was that?

192
00:14:29,000 --> 00:14:32,000
Oh, Kil, Silva would like to see you now.

193
00:14:32,000 --> 00:14:34,000
Dad said that?

194
00:14:35,000 --> 00:14:36,000
Okay, then.

195
00:14:39,000 --> 00:14:41,000
[Milluki grumbles]

196
00:14:42,000 --> 00:14:43,000
Damn it, Grandpa!

197
00:14:43,000 --> 00:14:46,000
Why do you have to go
and spoil him all the time?

198
00:14:46,000 --> 00:14:49,000
That's why he's become such a little punk!

199
00:14:49,000 --> 00:14:50,000
[gasps]

200
00:14:51,000 --> 00:14:54,000
Because Killua is special, Mil.

201
00:14:55,000 --> 00:14:59,000
Tell me, in your opinion,
what do you think of Kil's potential?

202
00:15:00,000 --> 00:15:03,000
-It's incredible, sure.
-Yes, go on.

203
00:15:03,000 --> 00:15:05,000
I think it's safe to say

204
00:15:05,000 --> 00:15:08,000
he's the most talented Zoldyck
in the history of our family, right?

205
00:15:08,000 --> 00:15:11,000
Even Mama thinks so, and I have to agree.

206
00:15:12,000 --> 00:15:14,000
Very good assessments.

207
00:15:14,000 --> 00:15:19,000
But there's just no way he'll ever be
a good assassin. He's way too erratic.

208
00:15:19,000 --> 00:15:20,000
[Zeno] Erratic?

209
00:15:20,000 --> 00:15:24,000
A kid who wants to go and make friends
could never lead the Zoldyck family.

210
00:15:25,000 --> 00:15:28,000
In the end, he's too weak.
Well, mentally, at least.

211
00:15:29,000 --> 00:15:30,000
Hmm...

212
00:15:32,000 --> 00:15:36,000
-[Zeno] Yes, that is true.
-[Milluki] Right? Take me, for example.

213
00:15:36,000 --> 00:15:40,000
I'll kill anyone you want me to,
no questions asked.

214
00:15:40,000 --> 00:15:44,000
Oh, I almost forgot!
My newest bomb is a real winner, Grandpa!

215
00:15:44,000 --> 00:15:47,000
It's tiny enough that I can attach it
to a female mosquito,

216
00:15:48,000 --> 00:15:51,000
and I rigged it to explode
whenever it sucks on a target's blood.

217
00:15:52,000 --> 00:15:56,000
But the problem is that mosquitos
aren't great for precision targeting.

218
00:15:56,000 --> 00:15:58,000
-Mil?
-What?

219
00:15:58,000 --> 00:16:03,000
You're a sharp boy, but that doesn't mean
you're not an idiot, too.

220
00:16:05,000 --> 00:16:07,000
Oh, why must Father be this way?

221
00:16:08,000 --> 00:16:09,000
[sighs]

222
00:16:10,000 --> 00:16:13,000
I'm afraid that something has come up.
Farewell.

223
00:16:14,000 --> 00:16:15,000
Wait! Hold on!

224
00:16:17,000 --> 00:16:20,000
It's just that we'll be staying in town
for a little while.

225
00:16:21,000 --> 00:16:22,000
Please let Killua know.

226
00:16:23,000 --> 00:16:27,000
Yes, very well. I'll be sure to tell him.
Good day.

227
00:16:31,000 --> 00:16:34,000
Who are all of you? Tell me.

228
00:16:35,000 --> 00:16:36,000
We're all friends with Killua.

229
00:16:38,000 --> 00:16:39,000
You're his friends?

230
00:16:40,000 --> 00:16:43,000
[Kikyo] Kalluto! What are you doing?
Come along this instant!

231
00:16:43,000 --> 00:16:45,000
Coming! Sorry, Mother.

232
00:16:50,000 --> 00:16:53,000
It goes without saying,
but these people really creep me out.

233
00:16:53,000 --> 00:16:56,000
And I bet they were lying about
Killua not wanting to see us.

234
00:16:57,000 --> 00:17:02,000
Gon, we can't go back there just yet.
Maybe we should tail those two.

235
00:17:02,000 --> 00:17:05,000
Yeah, but if we go follow them,

236
00:17:05,000 --> 00:17:09,000
I'm worried that it would mean
a whole lot of trouble for her later on.

237
00:17:09,000 --> 00:17:11,000
Yeah. Good point.

238
00:17:11,000 --> 00:17:15,000
I will take you to the butler's quarters.

239
00:17:16,000 --> 00:17:19,000
There is a phone
that connects directly to the mansion.

240
00:17:20,000 --> 00:17:23,000
If Master Zeno answers it, he might...
[grunts]

241
00:17:24,000 --> 00:17:25,000
Who's Master Zeno?

242
00:17:26,000 --> 00:17:27,000
He is Master Killua's grandfather.

243
00:17:32,000 --> 00:17:34,000
[snorting]

244
00:17:36,000 --> 00:17:37,000
So, Kil...

245
00:17:38,000 --> 00:17:40,000
I hear you've made some friends.

246
00:17:42,000 --> 00:17:43,000
[Killua] Yeah.

247
00:17:44,000 --> 00:17:46,000
And what are they like?

248
00:17:46,000 --> 00:17:48,000
"What are they like?"

249
00:17:48,000 --> 00:17:50,000
They're a lot of fun to be with.

250
00:17:51,000 --> 00:17:52,000
I see.

251
00:17:55,000 --> 00:17:56,000
How was the Hunter Exam?

252
00:17:58,000 --> 00:18:00,000
Um, it was easy.

253
00:18:03,000 --> 00:18:06,000
-Sit over here by me, Kil.
-[Killua gasps]

254
00:18:07,000 --> 00:18:09,000
I want to hear all about it.

255
00:18:10,000 --> 00:18:11,000
[gasps]

256
00:18:12,000 --> 00:18:17,000
Your exam experiences,
who you met, how you felt.

257
00:18:18,000 --> 00:18:21,000
You can tell me anything, and everything.

258
00:18:22,000 --> 00:18:23,000
'kay.

259
00:18:24,000 --> 00:18:26,000
[rustling]

260
00:18:27,000 --> 00:18:31,000
I can't believe this.
Father didn't even ask me!

261
00:18:32,000 --> 00:18:35,000
And now, Kil has gone off
to lark about with Papa!

262
00:18:36,000 --> 00:18:39,000
[panting] Unforgivable!

263
00:18:40,000 --> 00:18:43,000
[Killua]
And then, you know what Gon said to him?

264
00:18:45,000 --> 00:18:48,000
He didn't want his legs cut off,
but he didn't want to surrender either!

265
00:18:49,000 --> 00:18:51,000
[both chuckling]

266
00:18:51,000 --> 00:18:54,000
-He's so selfish.
-He's interesting, all right!

267
00:18:55,000 --> 00:19:00,000
And then, Gon's opponent pointed a blade
at his forehead, and that's when Gon--

268
00:19:00,000 --> 00:19:01,000
Kil.

269
00:19:01,000 --> 00:19:02,000
[gasps]

270
00:19:04,000 --> 00:19:05,000
Do you want to see your friends?

271
00:19:08,000 --> 00:19:11,000
No need to hold back. Be honest.

272
00:19:13,000 --> 00:19:14,000
Thinking back... [sighs]

273
00:19:15,000 --> 00:19:19,000
...you and I have never really had
a father-son chat before.

274
00:19:21,000 --> 00:19:23,000
I was raised by my parents
to be an assassin.

275
00:19:24,000 --> 00:19:27,000
And I raised you the same way.

276
00:19:30,000 --> 00:19:32,000
But you and I are different,

277
00:19:33,000 --> 00:19:36,000
and it took you leaving home
for me to realize that.

278
00:19:37,000 --> 00:19:38,000
Oh...

279
00:19:40,000 --> 00:19:45,000
You are indeed my son,
and still, a person all your own.

280
00:19:45,000 --> 00:19:47,000
Live your life.

281
00:19:48,000 --> 00:19:52,000
Remember, you can come home
if you get tired, so...

282
00:19:54,000 --> 00:19:56,000
I'll ask you again.

283
00:19:57,000 --> 00:19:58,000
Do you want to see your friends?

284
00:20:00,000 --> 00:20:00,000
Mm-hm.

285
00:20:01,000 --> 00:20:02,000
Very well.

286
00:20:04,000 --> 00:20:07,000
You're free to go now. But Kil...

287
00:20:11,000 --> 00:20:12,000
Promise me one thing.

288
00:20:13,000 --> 00:20:16,000
That you will never betray your friends.

289
00:20:17,000 --> 00:20:18,000
Got that?

290
00:20:21,000 --> 00:20:25,000
I'll never betray them. I swear.

291
00:20:31,000 --> 00:20:36,000
[Kikyo] Kil? It's too late.
Those three have already left.

292
00:20:36,000 --> 00:20:37,000
Return to your cell.

293
00:20:39,000 --> 00:20:41,000
No way. I'm leaving.

294
00:20:41,000 --> 00:20:43,000
[screams] Kil!

295
00:20:44,000 --> 00:20:45,000
Oh...

296
00:20:47,000 --> 00:20:48,000
Step aside.

297
00:20:49,000 --> 00:20:51,000
[gasps]

298
00:20:54,000 --> 00:21:01,000
[Kikyo chuckling] Oh, Kil.
What a splendid icy glare you have!

299
00:21:08,000 --> 00:21:12,000
[Kikyo] What in the hell were you
thinking? Kil finally came home!

300
00:21:12,000 --> 00:21:14,000
[Silva]
Let the boy do what he wants for now.

301
00:21:15,000 --> 00:21:17,000
You're mad! Listen to yourself!

302
00:21:17,000 --> 00:21:21,000
If Kil is to be head of the family,
this stage is absolutely critical!

303
00:21:22,000 --> 00:21:23,000
So you know what's at stake.

304
00:21:24,000 --> 00:21:27,000
Good. Then stop your griping
and keep your mouth shut!

305
00:21:28,000 --> 00:21:34,000
[cackling] Don't worry,
he'll come back home one day.

306
00:21:35,000 --> 00:21:38,000
After all, he is my son.

307
00:21:40,000 --> 00:21:42,000
[narrator] Killua has been set free,

308
00:21:43,000 --> 00:21:47,000
but Silva confidently declares
that he will return as an assassin.

309
00:21:48,000 --> 00:21:52,000
Meanwhile, Gon and company
head to the butler's quarters.

310
00:21:52,000 --> 00:21:56,000
Whether they will make contact with Killua
remains to be seen.

311
00:21:59,000 --> 00:22:02,000
[theme music plays]

312
00:23:22,000 --> 00:23:25,000
[Gon] Next time.
"Can't See if You're Blind."

313
00:23:25,000 --> 00:23:28,000
Eye for an eye. Eye for a tooth?

314
00:23:28,000 --> 00:23:30,000
[Killua] That's tooth for a tooth!
